flowchart TD
    User([Student]) -->|types message| UINode

    subgraph UI ["AdvisorChat.tsx (client)"]
        UINode[Chat Panel] -->|reads| PlanCtx[(PlanContext\nplan + cachedCourses)]
        UINode -->|buildPlanContext\nformats semesters + courses| Payload[POST /api/chat\nmessages, planContext, model]
    end

    Payload --> RouteNode

    subgraph Route ["api/chat/route.ts (server)"]
        RouteNode[Build system prompt\ninject formatted plan] --> Loop

        Loop{{"Agentic loop\n(max 5 iterations)"}}
        Loop -->|call OpenRouter| LLM[(OpenRouter\nLLM API)]
        LLM -->|no tool_calls| Done[Return reply to client]
        LLM -->|tool_calls| Dispatch

        subgraph Tools ["lib/tools/"]
            Dispatch[executeTool\ndispatcher]
            Dispatch -->|search_courses| ST["searchCourses.ts\nSQLite LIKE query"]
            Dispatch -->|get_course_details| DT["getCourseDetails.ts\nSQLite exact lookup"]
            ST --> DB[(CourseInfo.db\ndept, number, title\ncredits, description)]
            DT --> DB
        end

        ST -->|CourseResult| Loop
        DT -->|CourseDetail| Loop
    end

    Done -->|reply string| UINode
    UINode -->|renders message bubble| User
    